{"repositoryId":1255903015,"availability":"available","full":"STRUGGLE1999/fashion-atlas-dossier","name":"fashion-atlas-dossier","description":"A borderless, de-SaaSified digital magazine and scholastic archive curating global avant-garde fashion aesthetics, architectural tailoring lineages, and semantic style lexicons onto a parchment-textured typographic grid.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-01T09:23:57Z","updated":"2026-10-18T02:06:20Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://fashion-atlas-dossier.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://fashion-atlas-dossier.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T03:03:10.052Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T03:03:10.052Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T03:03:10.052Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T03:03:10.052Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["FashionAtlas 把先锋剪裁、风格辞典和私人灵感板放进同一个阅读界面，并用 Gemini 兼容接口做有边界的策展对谈：只基于当前条目和站内文献回答，再把回答沉淀成可导出的 Dossier。","当前是一份可演示的产品原型，不是完整博物馆。第一用户是国内非科班的时尚爱好者：想看国外秀场和品牌动态，但经常碰到语言、付费墙和来源分散。知识库体量为：20 条风格辞典、12 本书、14 场秀、10 件馆藏示意、1 篇美学大纲、1 条教学趋势样本、1 条穿搭公式、1 部电影。配图为教学示意，不是馆藏原件扫描。","资讯策略是「公开外刊 RSS → 中文简报 → 保留原始链接」，不是转载全文，也不是全网热搜聚合。当日简报未写入时，首页会明确写尚未发布。"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/STRUGGLE1999/fashion-atlas-dossier/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"55d307625a9e4d4acb3cd631048e2f085bebbbd8cae1dd01829f87c92894d806","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T03:03:10.431Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T03:03:10.431Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"FashionAtlas 把先锋剪裁、风格辞典和私人灵感板放进同一个阅读界面，并用 Gemini 兼容接口做有边界的策展对谈：只基于当前条目和站内文献回答，再把回答沉淀成可导出的 Dossier。","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/STRUGGLE1999/fashion-atlas-dossier/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"55d307625a9e4d4acb3cd631048e2f085bebbbd8cae1dd01829f87c92894d806","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/STRUGGLE1999/fashion-atlas-dossier/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18